# ================================================================
# MindSenseAI Environment Configuration Guide
# MindSenseAI uses separate environment configurations:
#
# 1. Backend Environment:
#    Copy `backend/.env.example` -> `backend/.env`
#    Configure: GROQ_API_KEY, JWT_SECRET_KEY, and optional alert channels.
#
# 2. Frontend Environment:
#    Copy `frontend/.env.example` -> `frontend/.env.local`
#    Configure: NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE (defaults to http://localhost:8000)
# ================================================================

# --- Quick Reference Backend Variables ---
GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here
JWT_SECRET_KEY=your_secure_random_string_here
# DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./mindsense.db

# --- Quick Reference Frontend Variables ---
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE=http://localhost:8000
